  "title": "fix 3gpp nettrace timestamps",
  "description": "This makes 3GPP Nettrace timestamp behavior same as Wireshark 2.x.\nCurrently both seconds and nanoseconds are accumulated, which is unnecessary and also makes nanoseconds to overrun the int and affect time display of subsequent packets.\nWith this fix, nanoseconds are written 'as is', without increment.\nOnly seconds are incremented.",
